/T (EXE: Employee Experience Exchange, is a UAE-based community and consultancy on a mission to transform society by transforming work. We believe workplaces sit at the centre of our lives - and that when people thrive at work, communities and economies thrive too. We audit, advise and partner with organisations to create employee experiences that match their ambition. We bring together HR, internal communications, culture and leadership professionals across the GCC who share a belief that work can and should be better.  )
